:[{"def_id":0,"item_meta":{"name":[{"Ident":["lib",0]},{"Ident":["forward_step",0]}],"span":{"data":{"file_id":0,"beg":{"line":74,"col":0},"end":{"line":97,"col":1}},"generated_from_span":null},"source_text":"pub fn forward_step(h: &[C64], w: &[C64], z: &C64, dim: usize) -> Vec<C64> {\n    let mut out: Vec<C64> = Vec::with_capacity(dim);\n    let mut i = 0;\n    while i < dim {\n        let mut acc_re: f64 = 0.0;\n        let mut acc_im: f64 = 0.0;\n        let mut j = 0;\n        while j < dim {\n            // acc += h[i*dim + j] * w[j]\n            let hh = &h[i * dim + j];\n            let ww = &w[j];\n            acc_re += hh.re * ww.re - hh.im * ww.im;\n            acc_im += hh.re * ww.im + hh.im * ww.re;\n            j += 1;\n        }\n        // acc -= z * w[i]\n        out.push(C64 {\n            re: acc_re - (z.re * w[i].re - z.im * w[i].im),\n            im: acc_im - (z.re * w[i].im + z.im * w[i].re),\n        });\n        i += 1;\n    }\n    out\n}","attr_info":{"attributes":[{"DocComment":" One forward step of the Krylov recurrence:"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" ```text"},{"DocComment":"   w_{k+1} = (H − z_k I) w_k"},{"DocComment":" ```"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" `h` is the Hamiltonian as a dense `dim × dim` matrix in row-major order"},{"DocComment":" (`h[i * dim + j] = ⟨i|H|j⟩`), `w` the current vector, `z` the shift at"},{"DocComment":" step `k`, `dim` the Hilbert-space dimension.  This is the **fold body**"},{"DocComment":" of the forward sequence: the plan's T9 target \"the forward sequence"},{"DocComment":" `w_k = (H − z_k)w_{k−1}` as a fold\"."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" The `f64` arithmetic here is the rounding layer (T1–T5); the *index"},{"DocComment":" bookkeeping* (which entries of `h` and `w` combine) is what the generated"},{"DocComment":" model carries verbatim."}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":true,"opacity":"Transparent","lang_item":null,"diagnostic_item":null},"generics":{"regions":[{"index